SENTINEL Camel Race README
--------------------------

Welcome to the two-player game Camel Race!
Camel Race is a simple racing game for the reZet80 SENTINEL.
To start the game enter "CR" at the prompt and press ENTER.
The display reads "CAMEL RACE". Press any key to begin.

Your camels start at the leftmost display position, player 1 ("1UP") at the top
and player 2 ("2UP") at the bottom.
After the countdown ("3", "2", "1", "0") the race begins.
Press the "0" and "1" (player 1) or "ENTER" and "BACK" (player 2) keys
alternately to make your camel run.
One key must be completely pressed and released before pressing the other key.
The camel that reaches the right side of the display first wins.
So it's either "1UP WINS" or "2UP WINS".

Enjoy!

